@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+# SpellCone.csv: put it beside the client executable (the name can be changed with [SpellArea] ConeFile).
+# One spell per line, NO header: spell id, cone angle in degrees (above 0, up to 360). See SpellArea.md.
+# A listed spell is drawn as a cone; its radius is still the spell's own. Examples (placeholder ids, replace them):
+#   100001,60
+#   100002,90
+#   100003,180
